{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"880417697018548274","content":"This is how the real world congress was.  Hell, there were fights over Washington becoming king, slavery, all sorts of stuff.\n\nThe founding father mostly wanted to abolish slavery, but didn't have the southern states support if they did that.\n\nCompromises were made that day we paid for for centuries","created_at":"2021-08-28T14:13:46.376000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881179760267493416","reply_to_id":"881154840103895080","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"880417697018548274","content":"So everyone knows, Mr Smith was supposed to appear kind, helpful, and overall a good person.  In fact he was an archived.\n\nCrane wanted to bring in a character one of his players made named malathor.  A truly nice guy that is metaphorically cursed with creepiness, and to be off-putting and sus.\n\nThe goal was people would be so worried about what malathor was doing, you wouldn't actually be investigating the true evil.\n\nBoth were basically opposites, to a point Smith basically almost never told the truth, and malathor basically never lied.","created_at":"2021-08-28T14:20:57.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881181568058683472","reply_to_id":"881142259549102090","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"880417697018548274","content":"So as people joined mal pals, we dms tried to make sure they were in on the fun.  If you noticed, gobs, Tim, and myself always said in ooc, the mal was a good guy.  We just said it in the most sus way possible","created_at":"2021-08-28T14:22:16.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881181899454816287","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
